{"unit":133,"section":5,"cefr":"B1","objective":"express and understand opinions","skill":"Opinions","heading":"Opinions and arguments","phrases":[{"he":"לדעתי, זה רעיון טוב.","en":"In my opinion, this is a good idea.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"לדעתי","h":["in my opinion"]},{"w":"זה","h":["this","it"]},{"w":"רעיון","h":["idea"]},{"w":"טוב","h":["good"]}]},{"he":"אני לא מסכים עם הטענה הזאת.","en":"I don't agree with this claim.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I"]},{"w":"לא","h":["not","don't"]},{"w":"מסכים","h":["agree"]},{"w":"עם","h":["with"]},{"w":"הטענה","h":["the claim"]},{"w":"הזאת","h":["this"]}]},{"he":"הויכוח הזה לא יפתור כלום.","en":"This debate won't solve anything.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"הויכוח","h":["the debate"]},{"w":"הזה","h":["this"]},{"w":"לא","h":["not","won't"]},{"w":"יפתור","h":["will solve"]},{"w":"כלום","h":["anything","nothing"]}]},{"he":"אני תומך בביקורת הזאת.","en":"I support this criticism.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I"]},{"w":"תומך","h":["support","supporter"]},{"w":"בביקורת","h":["in the criticism"]},{"w":"הזאת","h":["this"]}]},{"he":"היא טוענת שהוא טועה.","en":"She claims that he is wrong.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"היא","h":["she"]},{"w":"טוענת","h":["claims","argues"]},{"w":"שהוא","h":["that he"]},{"w":"טועה","h":["is wrong","mistaken"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"מה דעתך?","en":"What is your opinion?","alt":["What do you think?"],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש לי דעה.","en":"I have an opinion.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זאת טענה חזקה.","en":"That is a strong claim.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני מסכים איתך.","en":"I agree with you.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני לא מסכימה.","en":"I don't agree.","alt":["I disagree."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא תומך בה.","en":"He supports her.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא מתנגדת לזה.","en":"She opposes this.","alt":["She is against this."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הביקורת הייתה קשה.","en":"The criticism was harsh.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא טוען שזה נכון.","en":"He claims that this is correct.","alt":["He argues that this is true."],"t":"t"},{"he":"לדעתי, הוא צודק.","en":"In my opinion, he is right.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם לא מסכימים.","en":"They don't agree.","alt":["They disagree."],"t":"l"},{"he":"מה הדעה שלך?","en":"What is your opinion?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היה ויכוח גדול.","en":"There was a big debate.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הטענה שלו חלשה.","en":"His claim is weak.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו מתנגדים לחוק.","en":"We oppose the law.","alt":["We are against the law."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הביקורת שלה צודקת.","en":"Her criticism is justified.","alt":["Her criticism is right."],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני לא טוען כלום.","en":"I am not claiming anything.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש פה ויכוח מיותר.","en":"There is an unnecessary debate here.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"התומכים שלו רבים.","en":"His supporters are many.","alt":["He has many supporters."],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה מסכים או מתנגד?","en":"Do you agree or oppose?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הדעה שלי לא משנה.","en":"My opinion doesn't matter.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"כולם טוענים שהם צודקים.","en":"Everyone claims they are right.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"לדעתה, הויכוח מיותר.","en":"In her opinion, the debate is unnecessary.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"היא מסכימה עם הביקורת.","en":"She agrees with the criticism.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני תומכת בדעה שלך.","en":"I support your opinion.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם מתנגדים לכל שינוי.","en":"They oppose any change.","alt":["They are against any change."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הטענה הזאת אין לה בסיס.","en":"This claim has no basis.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני מסכים, אבל יש בעיה.","en":"I agree, but there is a problem.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הביקורת שלו תמיד שלילית.","en":"His criticism is always negative.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"למה אתה מתנגד להצעה?","en":"Why do you oppose the proposal?","alt":["Why are you against the proposal?"],"t":"t"},{"he":"לדעתי, הביקורת מוצדקת.","en":"In my opinion, the criticism is justified.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הויכוח בין התומכים והמתנגדים נמשך.","en":"The debate between supporters and opponents continues.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני לא מסכים עם הדעה הזאת בכלל.","en":"I don't agree with this opinion at all.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא טוענת שהביקורת לא הוגנת.","en":"She claims that the criticism is unfair.","alt":["She argues that the criticism is unfair."],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא תומך בטענה למרות הביקורת.","en":"He supports the claim despite the criticism.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"כל אחד יכול להביע את דעתו.","en":"Everyone can express their opinion.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא מתנגד לכל דבר שאני אומר.","en":"He opposes everything I say.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הויכוח הזה לא מוביל לשום מקום.","en":"This debate isn't leading anywhere.","alt":["This argument leads nowhere."],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני מסכימה שצריך לשנות את החוק.","en":"I agree that the law needs to be changed.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הדעות חלוקות בנושא הזה.","en":"Opinions are divided on this issue.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"מה":"what","דעתך":"your opinion","יש":"there is / have","לי":"I have / to me","דעה":"opinion","זאת":"this / that (feminine)","טענה":"claim / argument","חזקה":"strong (feminine)","אני":"I","מסכים":"agree (masculine singular)","איתך":"with you","לא":"not / don't","מסכימה":"agree (feminine singular)","הוא":"he","תומך":"supports / supporter (masculine singular)","בה":"in her / her","היא":"she","מתנגדת":"opposes (feminine singular)","לזה":"to this","הביקורת":"the criticism","הייתה":"was (feminine)","קשה":"harsh / hard / difficult","טוען":"claims / argues (masculine singular)","שזה":"that this","נכון":"correct / true / right","לדעתי":"in my opinion","צודק":"right / correct (masculine singular)","הם":"they","מסכימים":"agree (masculine plural)","הדעה":"the opinion","שלך":"your / yours","היה":"was / there was","ויכוח":"debate / argument","גדול":"big / large","הטענה":"the claim","שלו":"his","חלשה":"weak (feminine)","אנחנו":"we","מתנגדים":"oppose (masculine plural)","לחוק":"to the law","שלה":"her / hers","צודקת":"right / justified (feminine)","כלום":"anything / nothing","פה":"here","מיותר":"unnecessary","התומכים":"the supporters","רבים":"many / numerous","אתה":"you (masculine singular)","או":"or","מתנגד":"opposes / opponent (masculine singular)","שלי":"my / mine","משנה":"matters / changes","כולם":"everyone / everybody","טוענים":"claim / argue (masculine plural)","שהם":"that they","צודקים":"right / correct (masculine plural)","לדעתה":"in her opinion","הויכוח":"the debate / the argument","עם":"with","תומכת":"supports / supporter (feminine singular)","בדעה":"in the opinion","לכל":"to any / to every","שינוי":"change","הזאת":"this (feminine)","אין":"there is not / has no","לה":"to her / she has","בסיס":"basis / foundation","אבל":"but","בעיה":"problem","תמיד":"always","שלילית":"negative (feminine)","למה":"why","להצעה":"to the proposal","מוצדקת":"justified (feminine)","בין":"between","והמתנגדים":"and the opponents","נמשך":"continues","בכלל":"at all","טוענת":"claims / argues (feminine singular)","שהביקורת":"that the criticism","הוגנת":"fair (feminine)","בטענה":"in the claim","למרות":"despite","כל":"every / each","אחד":"one","יכול":"can","להביע":"to express","את":"(object marker)","דעתו":"his opinion","דבר":"thing","שאני":"that I","אומר":"say / saying","הזה":"this (masculine)","מוביל":"leads / leading","לשום":"to any / to no","מקום":"place","שצריך":"that it is necessary","לשנות":"to change","החוק":"the law","הדעות":"the opinions","חלוקות":"divided (feminine plural)","בנושא":"on the issue / on the topic","זה":"this / it","טוב":"good","רעיון":"idea","שהוא":"that he","טועה":"wrong / mistaken","יפתור":"will solve","בביקורת":"in the criticism"},"words":[{"he":"דעה","en":"opinion","alt":["view"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"de'ah"},{"he":"טענה","en":"claim","alt":["argument"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ta'anah"},{"he":"ויכוח","en":"debate","alt":["argument","dispute"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"vikuakh"},{"he":"ביקורת","en":"criticism","alt":["critique","review"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"bikoret"},{"he":"לטעון","en":"to claim","alt":["to argue"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"lit'on"},{"he":"להסכים","en":"to agree","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"lehaskim"},{"he":"להתנגד","en":"to oppose","alt":["to object"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"lehitnagged"},{"he":"תומך","en":"supporter","alt":["supports"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tomekh"},{"he":"מסכים","en":"agree","alt":["agrees"],"from":"skill","tr":"maskim"},{"he":"מסכימה","en":"agree (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"maskimah"},{"he":"מתנגד","en":"opposes","alt":["opponent"],"from":"skill","tr":"mitnagged"},{"he":"מתנגדת","en":"opposes (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mitnaggedet"},{"he":"טוען","en":"claims","alt":["argues"],"from":"skill","tr":"to'en"},{"he":"טוענת","en":"claims (feminine)","alt":["argues"],"from":"skill","tr":"to'enet"},{"he":"להביע","en":"to express","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"lehabi'a"},{"he":"מוצדקת","en":"justified","alt":["warranted"],"from":"skill","tr":"mutzedeket"},{"he":"לדעתי","en":"in my opinion","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"leda'ati"},{"he":"לדעתה","en":"in her opinion","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"leda'atah"},{"he":"הביקורת","en":"the criticism","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"habikoret"},{"he":"הויכוח","en":"the debate","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"havikuakh"}],"lexemes":["דעה","דעתי","דעתך","דעתו","דעתה","הדעה","הדעות","טענה","הטענה","ויכוח","הויכוח","ביקורת","הביקורת","טוען","טוענת","טוענים","מסכים","מסכימה","מסכימים","מתנגד","מתנגדת","מתנגדים","תומך","תומכת","התומכים","והמתנגדים","לדעתי","לדעתה","להביע","מוצדקת","בביקורת","בטענה","בדעה"],"tips":"## Expressing Opinions\n\n### Key Phrases for Opinions\n| Hebrew | English |\n|---|---|\n| לדעתי | in my opinion |\n| לדעתך | in your opinion |\n| לדעתו / לדעתה | in his / her opinion |\n| אני חושב/ת ש... | I think that... |\n| נראה לי ש... | It seems to me that... |\n\n### Agreement and Disagreement\n| Agree | Disagree |\n|---|---|\n| אני מסכים/ה | I agree |\n| אני תומך/ת ב... | I support... |\n| בהחלט! | Absolutely! |\n| אני מתנגד/ת ל... | I oppose... |\n| אני לא מסכים/ה | I disagree |\n| חלילה! | God forbid! |\n\n### Making Arguments\nUse **טוען/טוענת** (claims/argues) to present positions:\n- הוא **טוען** שהמצב טוב. -- He **claims** the situation is good.\n- היא **טוענת** שצריך שינוי. -- She **argues** that change is needed.\n\n### The Word דעה\nThe word **דעה** (opinion) takes possessive suffixes:\n- דעת**י** -- my opinion\n- דעת**ך** -- your opinion\n- דעת**ו** / דעת**ה** -- his / her opinion\n\nWith the prefix **ל** it means \"in (someone's) opinion\":\n- **לדעתי** -- in my opinion"}